        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your career at the Multiversal Institute for the Rhythmic Arts (MIRA), an interdimensional school where music, magic, and friendship collide. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new friends from across realities and times to form a band that will rival the ages and unlock the power of rhythm with your bonds. Can your band make the audience scream Encore!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encore! is a rhythm game and a visual novel where you play as a new student at the Multiversal Institute for the Rhythmic Arts (MIRA). Practice your performance skills by tapping the arrow keys in time with songs, and gain access to new music and instruments by making friends at school. Curate your band from a slew of unique characters: a wild-western alien guitarist, an edgy angel harpist, a Victorian bassoonist, and many more. Learn more about each character’s story and play well with them to gain their affection. Win the Battle of the Bands at the end of the school year and make the audience yell Encore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a 45-minute main campaign and a free-play mode to try out any song in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by a student team, many of whom are first-time developers, at Amoriem Labs, the game development club at Yale! Follow us  for more updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Begin your career at the Multiversal Institute for the Rhythmic Arts (MIRA), an interdimensional school where music, magic, and friendship collide. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new friends from across realities and times to form a band that will rival the ages and unlock the power of rhythm with your bonds. Can your band make the audience scream Encore!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encore! is a rhythm game and a visual novel where you play as a new student at the Multiversal Institute for the Rhythmic Arts (MIRA). Practice your performance skills by tapping the arrow keys in time with songs, and gain access to new music and instruments by making friends at school. Curate your band from a slew of unique characters: a wild-western alien guitarist, an edgy angel harpist, a Victorian bassoonist, and many more. Learn more about each character’s story and play well with them to gain their affection. Win the Battle of the Bands at the end of the school year and make the audience yell Encore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a 45-minute main campaign and a free-play mode to try out any song in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by a student team, many of whom are first-time developers, at Amoriem Labs, the game development club at Yale! Follow us  for more updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Begin your career at the Multiversal Institute for the Rhythmic Arts (MIRA), an interdimensional school where music, magic, and friendship collide.  Encore! is a rhythm game and visual novel hybrid, where you must curate a band from wacky characters to win Battle of the Bands!",
